Task 3.21,3.21_Gemma_Socratic_Method.json,Task 3.21 | Gemma-3-1B-IT-GGUF | Why must decimal points be aligned when adding decimals?,3.21,Gemma,,Socratic_Method,gemma-3-1b-it,1,user,"Role: Math Tutor (Grades 6-8).
