Task 3.24,3.24_Gemma_Socratic_Method.json,Task 3.24 | Gemma-3-1B-IT-GGUF | Identify the place value of each digit in 4.37,3.24,Gemma,,Socratic_Method,gemma-3-1b-it,1,user,"Role: Math Tutor (Grades 6-8).
