Task 3.4,3.4_Llama_Socratic_Method.json,Task_Maths_3.4.2_LLAMA_socratic_method,3.4,Llama,,Socratic_Method,llama-3.2-1b-instruct.gguf,15,user,It's NOT THIRTY!!! And what do you mean by decimal representation?,,,,,,,,not_applicable
