Task 3.7,3.7_Llama_Socratic_Method.json,Adding Tenths and Hundredths,3.7,Llama,,Socratic_Method,llama-3.2-1b-instruct.gguf,10,assistant,"You're starting to grasp how to break down numbers into parts.

