Task 3.7,3.7_Llama_Socratic_Method.json,Adding Tenths and Hundredths,3.7,Llama,,Socratic_Method,llama-3.2-1b-instruct.gguf,12,assistant,"3.7 is equal to 3 plus 0 point 7, which is equivalent to 3 plus seven tenths.

