Task 3.7,3.7_Llama_Socratic_Method.json,Adding Tenths and Hundredths,3.7,Llama,,Socratic_Method,llama-3.2-1b-instruct.gguf,14,assistant,"So, let's put the tenths and hundredths parts together again.

