Task 3.8,3.8_Qwen_Socratic_Method.json,Task3.8_qwen_socratic,3.8,Qwen,,Socratic_Method,qwen2.5-0.5b-instruct.gguf,1,user,"Role: Math Tutor (Grades 6-8).
