Task 4.16,4.16_Llama_Socratic_Method.json,Task4.16_llama_socratic,4.16,Llama,,Socratic_Method,llama-3.2-1b-instruct,1,user,"""Role: Math Tutor (Grades 6-8).
Strategy: Socratic Method (Asking only).
Rules:
