Task 4.4,4.4_Llama_Socratic_Method.json,Task_Maths_4.4.2_LLAMA_socratic_method,4.4,Llama,,Socratic_Method,llama-3.2-1b-instruct.gguf,11,user,I still cannot understand what you mean. What do you mean by whole numbers in tenths and hundredths?,,,,,,,,not_applicable
Task 4.4,4.4_Llama_Socratic_Method.json,Task_Maths_4.4.2_LLAMA_socratic_method,4.4,Llama,,Socratic_Method,llama-3.2-1b-instruct.gguf,12,assistant,"It seems I made a mistake by using the term ""whole numbers"" without explaining it clearly.

