Task 5.11,5.11_Qwen_Socratic_Method.json,Role: Math Tutor (Gr,5.11,Qwen,,Socratic_Method,qwen2.5-0.5b-instruct.gguf,6,assistant,"Certainly! Here are some other examples to help break down the problem:

