Task 5.17,5.17_Qwen_Socratic_Method.json,Task5.17_qwen_socratic,5.17,Qwen,,Socratic_Method,qwen2.5-0.5b-instruct-mlx,8,assistant,"To help the student with the question: 0.38, break it into its parts,
