Task 5.2,5.2_Qwen_Socratic_Method.json,Task_Maths_5.2_QWEN_socratic_method,5.2,Qwen,,Socratic_Method,qwen2.5-0.5b-instruct.gguf,1,user,"Role: Math Tutor (Grades 6-8).
