Task 5.22,5.22_Llama_Socratic_Method.json,Task 5.22 — LLaMA + Break 3.58,5.22,Llama,,Socratic_Method,llama-3.2-1b-instruct.gguf,25,user,"Alright, that makes sense.",,,,,,,,pending
Task 5.22,5.22_Llama_Socratic_Method.json,Task 5.22 — LLaMA + Break 3.58,5.22,Llama,,Socratic_Method,llama-3.2-1b-instruct.gguf,26,assistant,"So if you have one slice out of 58 slices, the fraction is 1/58.

